WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:02.020
Back on Blu-ray and DVD.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.160
I've heard a great deal about you.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.340
Hey!

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.130
He's an expert in martial arts.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:09.990
A Master of Disguise.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.290
and an agent in total control.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.470
Let's kick some button.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.690
You don't have to fly these, sir.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.890
It's all coming back to me.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.140
Johnny English, Rebo, buy it Monday on Blu-ray and DVD.
